{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012cuzbLBaviRjYnUxLYH9jx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"Shared Python hook library for ceo-orchestration.\n2\t\n3\tThis package is imported by the single-file hooks in the parent directory\n4\t(`check_agent_spawn.py`, `audit_log.py`). Each hook inserts its parent dir\n5\ton `sys.path` before importing from `_lib`:\n6\t\n7\t    import sys\n8\t    from pathlib import Path\n9\t    sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).parent))\n10\t    from _lib import payload, redact, filelock, team\n11\t\n12\tThe package is deliberately stdlib-only so hooks have zero install cost.\n13\tPython minimum is 3.9 (the macOS system Python) — see `_python-hook.sh`\n14\tshim in A.4 for version resolution.\n15\t\n16\tModules:\n17\t- payload.py    — parse Claude Code PreToolUse/PostToolUse stdin JSON\n18\t- redact.py     — regex-based secret redaction + SHA-256 hashing\n19\t- filelock.py   — fcntl.flock context manager with timeout + stale detection\n20\t- team.py       — extract team member names from team.md / domain personas\n21\t- testing.py    — TestEnvContext base class for isolated unit tests\n22\t\"\"\"\n23\t\n24\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n25\t\n26\t__all__ = [\"payload\", \"redact\", \"filelock\", \"team\", \"testing\"]\n27\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dc5b5fe9-2c6b-46ea-80f3-b2c4ce2f3240","uuid":"8bcb8343-dbcd-4cdf-886c-3157f1fe1961","timestamp":"2026-11-13T18:29:34.347Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/9n/hm9srl0s1nz45_p12tj61pd80000gn/T/kit-repass-tree.nUJTgA/tree/.claude/hooks/_lib/__init__.py","content":"\"\"\"Shared Python hook library for ceo-orchestration.\n\nThis package is imported by the single-file hooks in the parent directory\n(`check_agent_spawn.py`, `audit_log.py`). Each hook inserts its parent dir\non `sys.path` before importing from `_lib`:\n\n    import sys\n    from pathlib import Path\n    sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(__file__).parent))\n    from _lib import payload, redact, filelock, team\n\nThe package is deliberately stdlib-only so hooks have zero install cost.\nPython minimum is 3.9 (the macOS system Python) — see `_python-hook.sh`\nshim in A.4 for version resolution.\n\nModules:\n- payload.py    — parse Claude Code PreToolUse/PostToolUse stdin JSON\n- redact.py     — regex-based secret redaction + SHA-256 hashing\n- filelock.py   — fcntl.flock context manager with timeout + stale detection\n- team.py       — extract team member names from team.md / domain personas\n- testing.py    — TestEnvContext base class for isolated unit tests\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\n__all__ = [\"payload\", \"redact\", \"filelock\", \"team\", \"testing\"]\n","numLines":27,"startLine":1,"totalLines":27}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012cuzbLBaviRjYnUxLYH9jx","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
